        "original_id": "2da207fe-9779-526f-a22c-00b3b4f7b18f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Braz\n- Projects: A Scholar Under Siege\n- Organizations: Georgia Southern University, University System of Georgia\n- Events: Cocking affair\n\nFacts:\n- Georgia Southern University was founded in 1906 as a land-grant college.\n- Georgia Southern University is part of the University System of Georgia and is the largest center of higher education in the southern half of Georgia.\n- A Scholar Under Siege is an opera in two acts by contemporary American composer Michael Braz.\n- Michael Braz also wrote the English-language libretto for A Scholar Under Siege.\n- A Scholar Under Siege was composed for the centenary of Georgia Southern University.\n- The Cocking affair was made into an opera entitled A Scholar Under Siege.",
